    "q-126779": {
      "dom_id": "step-q126779",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "A random variable $X$ has the probability distribution given below.\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{11}, & x=-2 \\\\ \\frac{5}{11}, & x=-1 \\\\ \\frac{4}{11}, & x=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$",
      "worked_solution": "If $X$ is a discrete random variable with probability mass function $f(x)$ and sample space $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each squared value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x) \\\\  & =(-2)^{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{11}+(-1)^{2}\\cdot \\frac{5}{11}+{0}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{4}{11} \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{2}{11}+1\\cdot \\frac{5}{11}+0\\cdot \\frac{4}{11} \\\\  & =\\frac{13}{11}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-126779-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{17}{11}",
              "html": "  <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"31\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
